permit
├── Given a freshly initialized proxy
│   └── It uses Staked DUSD, version 1, the chain ID and the proxy address as its domain
├── When a relayer submits a valid signed approval
│   └── It permits the spender to redeem the holder's shares
├── When the spender transfers permitted shares
│   └── It consumes the allowance and rejects signature replay
├── When the signature has expired
│   └── It reverts without consuming the nonce
├── When the timestamp equals the deadline
│   └── It accepts the signature
├── When another account signs the approval
│   └── It reverts without consuming the nonce
├── When the approval amount is changed
│   └── It reverts without consuming the nonce
├── When the signature is submitted to another proxy
│   └── It reverts without consuming the nonce
└── When the chain ID changes
    └── It updates the domain and rejects signatures from the previous chain
